15. PUBLIC HEARING regarding adoption of the 2024 International Fire
Code.
25 - 148
Resolution, 2024 Int'l Fire Code
Attachments:
Justin Arnold, Planning, said that Laramie County has been the issuing authority for
building permits since the county adopted the International Building Codes in 2003.
The State of Wyoming, under WS 35-9-121, delegated authority to Laramie County to
"enforce and interpret local or state building, existing building and electrical safety
standards" which meet statutory requirements. Public notice of the proposed
regulation was given on Feb 18, 2025.
Arnold said staff recommends the adoption of the 2024 International Fire Code with
amendments.
