17. PUBLIC HEARING regarding a zone change from MR - Medium
Density Residential to MU - Mixed Use for the E1/2 of Tract 20,
Cheyenne Irrigated Gardens, Laramie County, WY.
25 - 150
Cheyenne Irrigated Gardens, Zone Change
Attachments:
Justin Arnold, Planning, said David Quade, applicant, submitted a zone change
application for the E1/2 of Tract 20, Cheyenne Irrigated Gardens, located at 2118
Persons Rd. He said the purpose of the application is to change the zone district from
MR - Medium Density Residential to MU - Mixed Use to allow for outside surface or
indoor storage. Arnold said upon approval of the zone change request, the
submission of a site plan application will be required for any proposed commercial
operation.
Arnold said based on evidence provided, staff recommends approval with the
adoption of findings of fact a and b.
